{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a narrative-driven experience where nothing is as it seems.<br>A quiet town, days that repeat, and a routine that slowly begins to crack. What first feels ordinary soon turns into a disturbing chain of events that will challenge your perception of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game of traditional heroes or epic battles. Here, the struggle is internal, and every choice you make will bring you closer to hidden truths\u2026 or to more questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed environments, talk to characters whose stories shift based on your actions, and uncover hidden fragments that reveal what lies beneath the surface.<br>Time plays a crucial role: each day introduces variations, new clues, and the consequences of your previous decisions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884210/8e68559360bf81f71207ed0c88b731cf85fe7afa.jpg"},{"name":"Day 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884210/3fd3dca70d8fac7efc71a798e7637fd865df40b1.jpg"},{"name":"Day 0","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884210/e369965da967a51197579affb267a8e7eee3bdd4.jpg"},{"name":"Mysterious door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884210/06683e31a4d09d308c2dbce41d71789e444397cc.jpg"},{"name":"I don\u2019t understand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884210/72353c9919aae4ceaf997ddbefb9d8b56509df1b.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884210?t=1769202631","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884210/6a89dfae667427301b663d28d3dfb1956e8fbcc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769202631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/